# 12 — FINANCIAL ENGINE

This is the core of the product.

Build a reliable financial calculation system.

Do not perform financial calculations in random UI components.

Create a dedicated calculation and accounting layer.

It must support:

- Member deposits
- Payments
- Expenses
- Meal costs
- Fixed costs
- Variable costs
- Rent
- Utilities
- Adjustments
- Previous balances
- Current balances
- Refunds
- Outstanding dues

Implement configurable expense distribution methods.

Examples:

### Method 1 — Equal Distribution

Shared expense divided equally among eligible members.

### Method 2 — Meal-Based Distribution

Expense distribution based on meal count.

### Method 3 — Fixed Distribution

Each member pays a configured amount.

### Method 4 — Custom Distribution

Owner/manager manually assigns amounts.

### Method 5 — Hybrid Distribution

For example:

- Rent equally distributed
- Bazar meal-based
- Internet equally distributed
- Guest meals charged separately

Create a configurable expense allocation system.

